---
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>La Vision | ATK Music — Tournage, montage & formats courts</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="La Vision — tournage, montage vidéo et formats courts pour entreprises, indépendants, artistes et projets locaux."
    />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #050505;
        --paper: #efefef;
        --ink: #f4f4f4;
        --muted: #a7a7a7;
        --soft: #151515;
        --soft-2: #202020;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        --line-dark: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
        --max: 1280px;
        --pad: clamp(18px, 3.3vw, 48px);
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--bg); }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      body::selection { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
      button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }

      .page {
        width: min(var(--max), 100%);
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: var(--bg);
        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .nav {
        min-height: 74px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 22px;
        padding: 0 var(--pad);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--paper);
        font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.95vw, 0.78rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .nav__links {
        display: flex;
        gap: clamp(14px, 2vw, 32px);
      }

      .nav__links:last-child { justify-content: flex-end; }
      .nav__brand {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(300px, 0.95fr);
        min-height: min(820px, calc(100vh - 74px));
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .hero__copy {
        padding: clamp(42px, 7vw, 96px) var(--pad) var(--pad);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-start;
        gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 58px);
      }

      .kicker {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      }

      .kicker::before {
        content: "";
        width: 34px;
        height: 1px;
        background: currentColor;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        margin: 34px 0 0;
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.2vw, 6.4rem);
        line-height: 0.82;
        letter-spacing: -0.075em;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .hero h1 span { display: block; }

      .hero__bottom {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        gap: 26px;
        align-items: end;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 440px;
        color: #cfcfcf;
        font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
        line-height: 1.55;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 42px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        transition: background 0.18s, color 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
      }

      .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
      .btn--light { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--ink); }

      .hero__media {
        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
        min-height: 100%;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-rows: 1fr auto;
        background: #0b0b0b;
      }

      .poster {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 520px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #111;
      }

      .media-link {
        position: relative;
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        min-height: inherit;
        color: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .media-link::after {
        content: "Voir le post ↗";
        position: absolute;
        left: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        z-index: 3;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.24);
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.52);
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(6px);
        transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
      }

      .media-link:hover::after,
      .media-link:focus-visible::after {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .media-video,
      .media-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        min-height: inherit;
        display: block;
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.08);
      }

      .portrait .media-image,
      .work-media .media-video {
        filter: contrast(1.04) saturate(1.06);
      }

      .poster::after,
      .work-media::before,
      .portrait::after,
      .services-media::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background:
          linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 49.8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 50%, transparent 50.2%),
          repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0 1px, transparent 1px 9px);
        mix-blend-mode: overlay;
        opacity: 0.32;
      }

      .hero__caption {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
        gap: 18px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 22px var(--pad);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .section {
        padding: clamp(58px, 8vw, 110px) var(--pad);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .section--paper {
        background: var(--paper);
        color: #060606;
        border-bottom-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      }

      .section__head {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px);
        align-items: start;
        margin-bottom: clamp(34px, 6vw, 72px);
      }

      .label {
        color: currentColor;
        opacity: 0.55;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.2vw, 5.9rem);
        line-height: 0.88;
        letter-spacing: -0.075em;
        max-width: 100%;
        overflow-wrap: normal;
      }

      .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
        gap: clamp(22px, 4vw, 54px);
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .portrait {
        min-height: 620px;
        position: relative;
        background: #111;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .about-copy {
        display: grid;
        align-content: space-between;
        gap: 38px;
        padding: 6px 0;
      }

      .manifest {
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 5.4vw, 5.3rem);
        line-height: 0.9;
        letter-spacing: -0.075em;
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .body-text {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0;
        color: currentColor;
        opacity: 0.72;
        font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.2vw, 1.08rem);
        line-height: 1.62;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      .works {
        padding-right: 0;
      }

      .works-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-auto-flow: column;
        grid-auto-columns: minmax(230px, 24vw);
        gap: 16px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        padding: 0 var(--pad) 20px 0;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      }

      .works-row::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 8px; }
      .works-row::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); }

      .work-card {
        min-height: 420px;
        scroll-snap-align: start;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background:
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.01)),
          #111;
      }

      .work-media {
        flex: 1;
        min-height: 300px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #111;
      }

      .work-title {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      }

      .work-title span:last-child {
        display: grid;
        gap: 7px;
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .work-title strong,
      .work-title em,
      .work-title small {
        display: block;
      }

      .work-title strong {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .work-title em {
        color: #d8d8d8;
        font-style: normal;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .work-title small {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      .results-intro {
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .result-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .result-card {
        display: grid;
        gap: 26px;
        padding: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 42px);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background:
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.015)),
          #101010;
      }

      .result-card__head {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .result-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 3.45rem);
        line-height: 0.9;
        letter-spacing: -0.07em;
      }

      .result-card__meta,
      .result-source {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .result-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 18px 14px;
      }

      .stat {
        display: grid;
        gap: 4px;
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .stat strong {
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 4.8rem);
        line-height: 0.82;
        letter-spacing: -0.08em;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: #d8d8d8;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        line-height: 1.25;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .result-card .body-text {
        max-width: 620px;
      }

      .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
        gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 70px);
        align-items: start;
      }

      .services-media {
        min-height: 700px;
        background: #111;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .service-list {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .service-item {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        padding: clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 36px) 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .service-item h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-family: "Archivo Black", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.65vw, 3rem);
        line-height: 0.94;
        letter-spacing: -0.065em;
      }

      .price {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1.15vw, 1.02rem);
        line-height: 1.25;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .service-item .body-text { max-width: 560px; }
      .num { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }

      .contact-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(300px, 1.1fr);
        gap: clamp(26px, 5vw, 72px);
      }

      .contact-card {
        padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px);
        background: #0f0f0f;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .contact-card h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 4.8rem); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.065em; }
      .contact-links { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; }
      .contact-links a {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 18px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      }

      .form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .field {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .honey-field {
        position: absolute;
        left: -9999px;
        width: 1px;
        height: 1px;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .form-note {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      .field label {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      }

      .input {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: #080808;
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 18px;
        outline: none;
        border-radius: 0;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      textarea.input { min-height: 180px; resize: vertical; }
      .input:focus { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.46); }
      .form .btn { width: fit-content; margin-top: 8px; cursor: pointer; }

       .footer {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 24px var(--pad);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .page { border: 0; }
        .nav {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
          min-height: 62px;
        }
        .nav__links:first-child { display: none; }
        .nav__links:last-child { gap: 14px; }
        .nav__links:last-child a:nth-child(2) { display: none; }
        .nav__brand { order: -1; }

        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          min-height: auto;
        }
        .hero__media { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
        .poster { min-height: 72vh; }
        .hero__bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .actions { justify-content: flex-start; }

        .section__head,
        .about-grid,
        .result-cards,
        .services-grid,
        .contact-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .section__head { gap: 16px; }
        .portrait, .services-media { min-height: 430px; }
        .works-row { grid-auto-columns: minmax(250px, 78vw); }
        .work-card { min-height: 390px; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        :root { --pad: 16px; }
        .nav { font-size: 0.62rem; }
        .hero h1 {
          font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 13.8vw, 3.35rem);
          line-height: 0.88;
          letter-spacing: -0.055em;
        }
        .hero__copy { padding-top: 42px; overflow: hidden; }
        .lead { max-width: 100%; }
        .poster { min-height: 470px; }
        .hero__caption { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .btn { width: 100%; }
        .actions { width: 100%; }
        .section { padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 56px; }
        h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 11vw, 3rem); line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.055em; }
        .manifest {
          font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 14vw, 3.65rem);
          line-height: 0.94;
          letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        }
        .service-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
        .footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navigation de la landing">
        <div class="nav__links">
          <a href="#about">À propos</a>
          <a href="#works">Projets</a>
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
        </div>
        <a class="nav__brand" href="/lavision/" aria-label="La Vision ATK">ATK</a>
        <div class="nav__links">
          <a href="https://instagram.com/lavision.atk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
          <a href="mailto:contact@atkmusic.fr">E-mail</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <section class="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <div>
            <span class="kicker">La Vision / vidéo · montage · création</span>
            <h1><span>Des images</span><span>qui donnent</span><span>envie</span></h1>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__bottom">
            <p class="lead">
              Tournage, montage et formats courts pour entreprises, indépendants et artistes.
              De l'idée aux contenus prêts à publier — ou directement à partir de vos rushs.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="btn btn--light" href="#works">Voir les projets</a>
              <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__media">
          <div class="poster" aria-label="Vidéo principale Kobalt">
            <a class="media-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUnRTR0CDAz/?igsh=M3J5YXF1Y2QzNGVm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Voir le reel Kobalt Tattoo">
              <video
                class="media-video"
                autoplay
                muted
                loop
                playsinline
                preload="metadata"
                poster="/media/vision/posters/hero-kobalt.jpg"
                data-lazy-video
              >
                <source src="/media/vision/videos/hero-kobalt.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__caption">
            <span>Kobalt — vidéo / direction visuelle</span>
            <span>ATK Music © 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about" class="section section--paper" aria-label="À propos">
        <div class="section__head">
          <span class="label">01 / À propos</span>
          <h2>Donner une forme claire aux idées, aux sons et aux images.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="portrait" aria-label="Portrait ou image studio">
            <img class="media-image" src="/media/vision/images/about.jpg" alt="Portrait / image de travail ATK Music" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="body-text">
              Je m’appelle Lorenzo Cuadrado, je suis vidéaste et monteur dans le Var.<br /><br />
              Mon travail commence avant le montage : comprendre ce qu’on veut faire ressentir.
              Je cherche le rythme, le détail et la bonne manière de raconter pour rendre une vidéo plus claire,
              plus humaine et plus mémorable, en pensant aussi à la manière dont elle sera regardée et consommée.
            </p>
            <p class="manifest">UNE VRAIE PRÉSENCE POUR TON PROJET.</p>
            <p class="body-text">
              On peut partir d'une simple idée et tout produire, ou de rushs déjà existants.
              Tournage, narration, découpage, montage, formats et déclinaisons : le projet s'adapte à ce dont tu as réellement besoin.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="works" class="section works" aria-label="Portfolio">
        <div class="section__head">
          <span class="label">02 / Projets</span>
          <h2>Ce que j’ai produit.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="works-row" aria-label="Galerie de projets">
          <article class="work-card">
            <div class="work-media">
              <a class="media-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTxPnsLjxxt/?igsh=bHRlMm9leXhiMWcz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Voir le reel Sushi Pearl">
                <video class="media-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/vision/posters/project-sushi-pearl.jpg" data-lazy-video>
                  <source src="/media/vision/videos/project-sushi-pearl.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                </video>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="work-title"><span>01</span><span><strong>Sushi Pearl</strong><em>Tournage · montage · format vertical</em><small>Mise en valeur du lieu, de l’ambiance et de l’expérience client.</small></span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="work-card">
